  <!--
    The town plans of release F's peoples (Defs/PeopleDefs/Rimfolk_People_SignalLine.xml, _Deepwell.xml, _Republic.xml,
    _HollowFleet.xml; docs/design/peoples.md, "Release F"), laid by the same code as the others (Peoples/PeopleTowns.cs):
    the Signal Line's relay with its mast on the highest ground, the Deepwell Union's pit with its headframe and slag
    heap, the Last Republic's town hall with its flag, archive, ration office and guardhouse, the Hollow Fleet's grounded
    hull with its landing pad and hydroponics. Rows from the north; an underscore is the ground as it is.
  -->

  <ColonyCouncil.TownPlanDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_LineRelay</defName>
    <label>Signal Line&apos;s relay</label>
    <description>The Signal Line's relay on the highest ground: its mast on a footing of four posts, the relay hut of concrete with its two consoles and a table where the operators eat between watches, a bunkhouse of ten beds, a cable yard of wire, parts and steel inside a fence, and a fire where the linemen dry their oilskins.</description>
