    <label>Deepwell Union&apos;s pit</label>
    <description>The Deepwell Union's pit: the headframe over the shaft on its eight posts, the slag heap beside it, the union hall where the book is kept on its shelves and every vote is taken round the long tables, a boarding house of twelve beds for the shifts, the smithy and store where the tools are mended and the ore weighed, and a fire for the end of the shift.</description>
