    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_RepublicHall</defName>
    <label>Republic&apos;s town hall</label>
    <description>A town of the Last Republic: the town hall in marble with the radio's two consoles on the dais and the council's tables before them, the flag on its pole in the square outside, the archive of the census and the old laws on its shelves, the ration office and its store, and the Civic Guard's guardhouse with its sandbags at the door.</description>
