  <ColonyCouncil.TownPlanDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_FleetHull</defName>
    <label>Hollow Fleet&apos;s hull</label>
    <description>The Hollow Fleet's grounded hull, its plating made into walls: the bridge with its two consoles and the officers' mess, the crew deck of nine bunks, the sleepers' hold of five cryptosleep caskets beside the ship's stores, the hydroponics bay of four basins, and the landing pad of metal plates, kept clear for a shuttle that may one day carry the order to disembark.</description>
